{"schema":"hsr-dialogue.v1","entryId":"other-interaction-p15862","chapterId":"s4b53aa6c339124d9","referenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","rows":[{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-7cfb866dfc6f312792e0","entryId":"other-interaction-p15862","chapterId":"s4b53aa6c339124d9","text":"윙윙——듣기 좋지! 우리 부인의 노래를 듣는 것 같아, 윙~","speaker":"음률에 정통한 나비","mission":"상호작용 기록","scene":"음률에 정통한 나비","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["3522334928260723036"],"speakerHashCandidates":["12348414501483793859"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-74a8cb69130484487a43","entryId":"other-interaction-p15862","chapterId":"s4b53aa6c339124d9","text":"이 악기는 해롱해롱한 언니의 축복을 받았대…. 이렇게 맑은 선율을 연주할 줄이야, 윙~","speaker":"음률에 정통한 나비","mission":"상호작용 기록","scene":"음률에 정통한 나비","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["10380440958180449025"],"speakerHashCandidates":["12348414501483793859"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-229f46d0a3e2bbc851ce","entryId":"other-interaction-p15862","chapterId":"s4b53aa6c339124d9","text":"회색 머리 청중, 어떻게 생각해, 윙?","speaker":"음률에 정통한 나비","mission":"상호작용 기록","scene":"음률에 정통한 나비","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["1193192388153865208"],"speakerHashCandidates":["12348414501483793859"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-22b1073f87412b7984f1","entryId":"other-interaction-p15862","chapterId":"s4b53aa6c339124d9","text":"정말 좋아","speaker":"","mission":"상호작용 기록","scene":"음률에 정통한 나비","type":"choice","textHashCandidates":["2049257625154168542"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-633669687f2428888bf2","entryId":"other-interaction-p15862","chapterId":"s4b53aa6c339124d9","text":"그렇지! 맑은 샘물이 흐르는 것처럼 듣는 사람과 벌레의 심신을 즐겁게 해 주네, 윙!","speaker":"음률에 정통한 나비","mission":"상호작용 기록","scene":"음률에 정통한 나비","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["8452920656889842897"],"speakerHashCandidates":["12348414501483793859"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-b